      70.8,
      370.56,
      311.05,
      428.63
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitiude* which is required fora public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
